*** Begin ECU Patch
Key: 028-codex-local-dataset-surfaces
Title: Local Codex engine and Reaction Dataset surfaces
Purpose: Make local Codex app-server execution and the approved Reaction Dataset provider contract first-class while preserving the existing sandbox path and causal Dataset behavior.

*** Begin Context
The current working tree is the canonical iteration state. This patch records the scoped Reactor, OpenAI Reactor, Dataset, and Events changes without including concurrent work in other packages.

Approved product decisions:
- codexEngine() runs the local logged-in Codex directly when no sandbox is supplied.
- Sandbox execution remains selected by input.sandbox.
- buildReactionDataset is the explicit public provider adopted by consumer runtimes as a readonly property.
- Agent Dataset materialization uses the current top-level query contract and paginated dataset.read evidence.
*** End Context

